The main purpose of this step is to identify members who have unsubscribed from the SMS program. These members must be removed from future campaign targeting, so this is an important compliance step.
We generate this report using a Python script. At the beginning of the script, logging and retry handling are configured. Logging captures the complete execution details, and the retry logic helps the script recover from temporary API or server issues.
The script then authenticates with the SMS Manager API using OAuth client credentials. It retrieves an access token and automatically renews it when required.”
