“This section is responsible for authentication. Rather than requesting a token for every API call, the script checks whether the current token is still valid and renews it only when necessary.”
Then continue:
“Once authentication is complete, the script calls the subscriptions endpoint for the required program and requests records where the status is unsubscribed.
Since the API can return a large number of records, the script processes the results page by page. In this case, it retrieves up to one thousand records per page and continues until all available pages are processed.”
Show fetch_all_unsubscribed
