“This section sorts the outbound messages from newest to oldest and selects the first valid campaign template after excluding confirmation and welcome messages.”
Then explain the merge:
“After the API extraction is complete, the results are matched with the original member file using the GMPI ID.
This adds the member’s first name, last name, and phone number to the API response. An inner join is used, so the final report contains only members who are present in the campaign file and also have a matching unsubscribe record.”
